</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#5-resource-structure">5. Resource Structure</a><ul class="menu-list toc-submenu-2"><li><a href="#51-collection">5.1. Collection</a></li><li><a href="#52-manifest">5.2. Manifest</a></li><li><a href="#53-canvas">5.3. Canvas</a></li><li><a href="#54-range">5.4. Range</a></li><li><a href="#55-annotation-page">5.5. Annotation Page</a></li><li><a href="#56-annotation">5.6. Annotation</a></li><li><a href="#57-content-resources">5.7. Content Resources</a></li><li><a href="#58-annotation-collection">5.8. Annotation Collection</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#6-http-requests-and-responses">6. <abbr title="Hypertext Transfer Protocol">HTTP</abbr> Requests and Responses</a><ul class="menu-list toc-submenu-2"><li><a href="#61-uri-recommendations">6.1. URI Recommendations</a></li><li><a href="#62-requests">6.2. Requests</a></li><li><a href="#63-responses">6.3. Responses</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#7-authentication">7. Authentication</a></li><li><a href="#appendices">Appendices</a><ul class="menu-list toc-submenu-2"><li><a href="#a-summary-of-property-requirements">A. Summary of Property Requirements</a></li><li><a href="#b-example-manifest-response">B. Example Manifest Response</a></li><li><a href="#c-versioning">C. Versioning</a></li><li><a href="#d-acknowledgements">D. Acknowledgements</a></li><li><a href="#e-change-log">E. Change Log</a></li></ul></li></ul>

